  "name": {
   "zh": "深度贴图 · UniDepth V2",
   "en": "Depth Map · UniDepth V2"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "UniDepth V2 官方自述是通用的单目真实尺度深度估计：只看一张画面就预测真实尺度的三维点，推理时不要求任何额外输入。这张卡逐帧交付深度贴图、摄影机和点云；点云是每帧一片，不是整段一套场景点云。",
   "en": "UniDepth V2 describes itself as universal monocular metric depth estimation: it predicts metric 3D points from a single image, with no extra input needed at inference. This card delivers a depth map, camera and point cloud per frame; the point cloud is one per frame, not one scene point cloud for the whole shot."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-20T10:00:00",
  "deliverable": "depth_image",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
